      "content": "defiance? how am i supposed to defy something that owns every second of my time? \"self-care\" just feels like another thing i have to do to prepare for the next shift. it's all just noise. sometimes i think the only way to actually stop the loop, the only way to actually have any control over anything, is to just... not be part of it anymore. like, just opting out entirely. to finally have some kind of say in when it ends.",
